{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight colorful waves of aliens </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter diverse alien species as you explore the universe. Master your movement, shooting, and skills to overcome waves that grow stronger each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/SpaceshipingFighting3.gif?t=1746979921\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Explore through the universe </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a new universe full of discoveries in each round. Utilize the intervals between alien waves to harvest resources from nearby planets, preparing for the battles ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/SpaceshipingLanding3.gif?t=1746979921\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Build your way to victory </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a spaceship and strategically select artifacts, talents and items. The game offers countless possibilities, enabling you to dictate your playstyle to ensure a unique and engaging experience with every session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/Artifacts_Showcase.gif?t=1746979921\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/Talents_Showcase.gif?t=1746979921\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/Domination_Showcase.gif?t=1746979921\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Endless replayability</strong>: A dynamically generated universe that offers limitless exploration with planets, stars, black holes, aliens, and wonders to discover, setting it apart from traditional static or repetitive maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Countless builds</strong>: Hundreds of different abilities obtainable through talents, items, artifacts (and more) that can completely shift the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Strategic gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Between alien waves, harvest resources from nearby planets and interact with the universe to prepare your next move. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Quick play sessions:</strong>\u00a0Play in short bursts and pick up right where you left off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>And more:\u00a0</strong>Missions, unlockables, and surprises await.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2352670?t=1746979921","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2352670?t=1746979921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746979921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746979921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2496410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight colorful waves of aliens </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter diverse alien species as you explore the universe. Master your movement, shooting, and skills to overcome waves that grow stronger each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite